repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/DCST"
abstract: >-
  DCST models each PDAC patient as a multi-scale spatiotemporal dynamical system,
  unifying a residual Heterogeneous Graph Transformer, hierarchical Bayesian digital twin,
  uncertainty-aware causal planner, and adaptive DP-FedAvg under differential privacy.
  Leakage-free evaluation on an in-silico cohort (N=800) and real TCGA-PAAD (N=92).
